    <detaileddescription>
<para>Clients can use this class to add LinkGraphs to an <ref refid="classllvm_1_1orc_1_1_execution_session" kindref="compound">ExecutionSession</ref>, and it serves as a base for the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1orc_1_1_object_linking_layer" kindref="compound">ObjectLinkingLayer</ref> that can link object files. </para>
